/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:120:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:121:    """
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:122:    Fill each diagonal marker pair's bounding box only when an unobstructed border corridor connects the two corners.
