/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:124:    Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:125:    - The grid has one dominant background color, one obstacle color, and several
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:126:      other colors that each appear exactly twice as diagonal corner markers.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:127:    - The obstacle pixels form straight barrier segments.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:128:    - Each marker pair defines an axis-aligned bounding box whose interior may or
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:129:      may not contain obstacle pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:130:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:131:    Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:132:    - For each same-color marker pair, inspect the two L-shaped border corridors
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:133:      between the opposite corners: horizontal-then-vertical and vertical-then-horizontal.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:134:    - If at least one corridor avoids the obstacle color entirely, recolor every
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:135:      background cell in that whole bounding box to the pair color while keeping
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:136:      obstacle pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:137:    - If both corridors are blocked by obstacle pixels, erase the two corner
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:138:      markers back to the background; obstacles never change.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:139:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:140:    Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:141:    - Visibility is tested only on the bounding-box border routes, not through the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:142:      box interior, so interior barriers can remain visible inside a successful fill.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:143:    """
