/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:154:            fill_mask = input_bg[r0 : r1 + 1, c0 : c1 + 1]
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:155:            out_window = out[r0 : r1 + 1, c0 : c1 + 1]
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/1/025/3.py:156:            assert not np.any(fill_mask & (out_window != bg)), "overlapping fills are ambiguous"
